content.text:
Hi {{ name | default: 'there' }}! 
Your BubuLemon order has shipped.
Track your order: {{ trackingNumber }}

x-code-samples.source:
curl -X POST 'https://comms.twilio.com/preview/Messages' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "to": [{
        "address": "+12065551337",
        "channel": "PHONE"
    }],
    "content": {
        "text": "What day is it?"
    }
}'\
-u $TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID:$TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN \

curl -X POST 'https://comms.twilio.com/preview/PushNotifications' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "to": [
        { "provider": "FCM", "token": "token" }
    ],
    "content": {
        "title": "Limon Eats",
        "text": "Your order is on the way!"
    }
}'\
-u $TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID:$TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN

curl -X PATCH 'https://comms.twilio.com/preview/SenderPools/comms_senderpool_01h9krwprkeee8fzqspvwy6nq8' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "name": "Customer Support Senders - Tier 1",
    "tags": { "tier": "1" }
}'\
-u $TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID:$TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN

TagsString.description:
Custom metadata in the form of key-value pairs.
Must be in the key value format: key1:value;key2:value;

Example:
```json
{
  "key1":"value1",
  "key2":"value2"
}
```

Should be inputted as:
```
?tags=key1:value;key2:value;
```
